02 · COMMUNICATION PREFERENCES
:::

:::text id=slide3_title x=80 y=95 w=929 h=64 preset=title align=left color=text fontSize=40
# How We Connect — Communication Preferences & Rules
:::

:::shape id=slide3_card1 x=80 y=175 w=450 h=430 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=slide3_icon1 name=message-square x=104 y=190 w=28 h=28 color=#0891B2
:::

:::text id=slide3_text1a x=104 y=225 w=400 h=180 preset=body align=left color=text
**Preferred Channels:**
Slack/Teams (Chat): Best for non-mentally taxing and quick info exchange.
Face-to-Face or Call: Best for complex or easily misunderstood topics.
Email: Best for official decisions or third-party communications.
:::

:::text id=slide3_text1b x=104 y=415 w=400 h=170 preset=body align=left color=text
**Boundaries:**
Context upfront: Context provided upfront unless mutual understanding is established.
One at a time: Only handle one face-to-face or live call conversation at a time.
:::

:::shape id=slide3_card2 x=550 y=175 w=459 h=430 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=slide3_icon2 name=list-checks x=574 y=190 w=28 h=28 color=#0891B2
:::

:::text id=slide3_text2 x=574 y=225 w=410 h=360 preset=body align=left color=text
**Standard 3-Step Format:**
1. Context (facts only)
2. Problem definition
3. Proposed solutions (if any)
:::